#. module: l10n_kw_hr_payroll
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_kw_hr_payroll
msgid ""
"\n"
"Kuwait Payroll & Localization\n"
"=============================\n"
"- Basic setup for Kuwait payroll (Company, Employees, Schedule).\n"
"- **Social Insurance:** Kuwaiti Social Security deduction & company "
"contribution rules.\n"
"- **End of Service:** EOS Benefit (Indemnity) and Monthly Provision "
"calculations.\n"
"- **Leaves & Provisions:** Annual Leave provision and Kuwaiti Sick Leave "
"logic (Tiered deduction).\n"
"- Includes \"Kuwait: Monthly Pay\" salary structure.\n"
msgstr ""

